PLACEHOLDER - not a real file.

Replace this with the STL export of the back cover part.

In Onshape: right click the cover part in the Parts list -> Export ->
Format STL, Binary, units mm. Save in this folder as exactly:

    SNAPX-cover.stl

Then delete this .PLACEHOLDER file. If your Part Studio names the part
something else, keep your name but update cad/README.md to match.
